<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh M2 money supply rises 3.0 pct in Sep.</title>
<headline>Kazakh M2 money supply rises 3.0 pct in Sep.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan's M2 money supply rose 3.0 percent in September after a 1.8 fall in August, the National Bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> KAZAKH MONEY SUPPLY				Sep 1  Aug 1  Jan 1</p>
<p> M2 volume (billion tenge)			123.9  120.2  117.7</p>
<p> month-on-month pct change			 +3.0   -1.8    n/a</p>
<p> monetary base (M1)				  68.7   64.1   63.9</p>
<p> month-on-month pct change			 +7.1   +4.5    n/a</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures for 1995 not available.</p>
<p>--Timur Nurpeisov, Almaty newsroom (3272) 509410</p>
</text>
